flowchart TD
    %% Conn: the retried temp directory create
    stmt[Run statement] --> err{IoError PermissionDenied tempdir?}
    err -->|no| result([Return result or error])
    err -->|yes| tx{Transaction dropped?}
    tx -->|no| again[Run the statement once more]
    tx -->|yes| replay[Replay the journal]
    replay --> same{Every statement returns what it did?}
    same -->|yes| again
    same -->|no| original[Return the original error]
    again --> result
    original --> result
